 Source: TEVOI (Smith & Atchison, The Eye and Visual Optical Instruments, Cambridge University Press 1997), Appendix 3 'Schematic eyes', p. 789, Gullstrand number 2 simplified eye: Accommodated.
 Cornea R 7.8 mm; aqueous and vitreous n = 4/3; lens n 1.416, R 5.0 / -5.0 mm, 4.0 mm thick, 3.2 mm behind the cornea.
 Eye power 69.721 D, length 23.896 mm. Nothing has been added to the published eye. The 4 mm stop (at the front of the lens) is the app's usual pupil.
----------------------------------------------*/
